 {query:lit.searches.Q2.query,site:'PubMed E-utilities esearch/esummary (relevance), efetch for abstracts',searched_on:DATE,purpose:'R7A1-SSCTR-r1 S1 and S4: evidence on gating resumed volume by the most recent session, and on adopting an effort-chosen load.',result_notes:`${lit.searches.Q2.count} hits, 20 listed. Abstract read: Hickmott 2022 (R7A1-S04). No study compares a last-session rule with an any-session rule for restoring set counts; a negative result logged, not read as absence of evidence. Europe PMC full-text access re-checked (PMC13674372, HTTP ${lit.europePmcFullTextCheck.status}).`}
